SECRETS DIRECTORY
=================

This directory holds Docker secret files. Each file contains exactly one secret
value with no trailing newline. The directory is excluded from git.

Required files (create these on the server before starting the stack):

  db_password.txt           — PostgreSQL dashboard user password
  backup_github_token.txt   — GitHub personal access token for the backup repo
  smtp_password.txt         — SMTP account password for email delivery
  smtp_user.txt             — SMTP username / login address
  npm_api_email.txt         — NPM admin email (used by the CA service)
  npm_api_password.txt      — NPM admin password (used by the CA service)
  abuseipdb_key.txt         — AbuseIPDB API key
  maxmind_license_key.txt   — MaxMind license key for GeoLite2 downloads

Setup on the server:
  sudo mkdir -p /path/to/nginx-dashboard/secrets
  sudo chmod 700 /path/to/nginx-dashboard/secrets
  echo -n "your-password-here" | sudo tee /path/to/nginx-dashboard/secrets/db_password.txt
  sudo chmod 600 /path/to/nginx-dashboard/secrets/*.txt

Never commit these files to git. The secrets/ directory is in .gitignore.
